  "details": "many worlds have private rooms, but they are actually not private and you can glitch into them, so why not give creators the ability to create inaccessible rooms in worlds that you can enter by using a panel or button in the world?\n\nthis will allow creators to make better private rooms inside of an instance and it would increase performance by fully culling an avatar\n\nimagine a world full with 80 people but divided in 8 rooms, if each room has 10 people, it will feel like the instance is as laggy as a 10 people instance now.\n\nthis will make it possible for quest users to enjoy VRChat a lot more, as well as low end computers to run it faster than ever\n\nHere at Enderia Network, we care about our members, no matter device, gender, or nationality, and such performance improvement would grant us better possibilities when it comes to hosting group instances in our custom worlds.",
